category: Devel
requires: cygwin libarchive13 libcurl4 libgcc1 libintl8 libpcre1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Alpm .files metadata explorer"
ldesc: "pkgfile searches the .files metadata created by repo-add(8) to retrieve file
information about packages. By default, the provided target is considered to
be a filename and pkgfile will return the package(s) which contain this file.
The repos which pkgfile searches is determined by those enabled in
/etc/pacman.conf."

